    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</m